  "body": "- [x] Bump the version of Black we use for code formatting\r\n- [x] Bump the `tool.black.target-version` in pyproject.toml\r\n- [x] Run Black on all the things\r\n- [x] Update our Trove classifiers to drop support for 3.6\r\n- [x] Update CI configuration to stop testing on 3.6 (including updating the `olddeps` test run)\r\n- [x] Update .deb build script to stop building for Ubuntu Bionic (18.04) ~~and Ubuntu Hirsute (21.04)~~\r\n- [x] Get rid of the SyTest image that uses Bionic (and figure out what to replace it with)\r\n- [x] Grep source and docs for anything referencing Python 3.6, Bionic, or Hirsute and excise it\r\n- [x] Run pyupgrade\r\n- [ ] ~~Consider taking advantage of `from __future__ import annotations` from [PEP 563](https://docs.python.org/3.10/whatsnew/3.7.html#pep-563-postponed-evaluation-of-annotations) to speed up application start?~~\r\n- [x] Get rid of anything referencing PostgreSQL 9.6; our new minimum version is 10. (Check SyTest too)",
